+- Moving a task requires manager rights on the source project and write rights
+  (contributor or manager, not archived) on the destination. The destination
+  must be readable by the user (else 404). Moving into the same project → 400.
+  The assignee is kept, but must be a contributor or manager of the destination;
+  otherwise the move is 400 and nothing changes.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
